Scripts are stored in named folders inside the 'content' directory.
In the selection dialogue, you choose a folder, then a file.
The file name is displayed as the chapter name.
Underscores are converted to spaces.
If you write 'zzz-' before your folder name, it gets displayed as an underscore.
This is to help sort folders as 'less important'.
A folder name starting with an underscore will not display the first underscore and be sorted to the top.
Next- writing scripts.